source: tests/stages.rs
expression: reports.report(path)
input_file: tests/fixtures/expand/doc_macro_tool_pages.knv
---
(def defrule-page "(defrule name (pattern template) ...)\n\nDefines a macro by rules that each rewrite a call of one shape.\n\nThe first rule whose pattern matches the call's arguments gives the\nexpansion, its template filled with the pattern's variables. In a pattern,\n`name ...` matches zero or more forms. A docstring may follow the name.\n\n```\n(defrule swap ((a b) (pair b a)))\n\n(swap 1 2)\n=> (pair 2 1)\n```")
(def defmacro-page "(defmacro name pattern body ...)\n\nDefines a macro whose body computes the expansion of a call.\n\nThe pattern binds the call's arguments as a [defrule] pattern does, and the\nbody's last form is the expansion. A docstring may lead the body when\nanother form follows it.\n\n```\n(use code list)\n\n(defmacro twice (x)\n  (list (quote *) 2 x))\n\n(twice 4)\n=> 8\n```")
(def template-page "(template form)\n\nBuilds a form from a quoted form with holes in it.\n\n`(unquote x)` puts the value of `x` in place, and `(splice xs)` puts each\nform of the list `xs` in place, as in\n`(template (def (unquote name) (splice body)))`.\n\n```\n(defmacro twice (x)\n  (template (* 2 (unquote x))))\n\n(twice 4)\n=> 8\n```")
